    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>恭喜您在同行玩法中跻身本职业全国排名前100，特赠荣誉头衔，可前往</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\">【菜单-角色-头衔界面】</><M_Default>使用。</>"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default> Congratulations on ranking in the top 100 nationwide for your profession in the Companion mode. You have been awarded an honorary title. You can go to </><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\"> [Menu - Character - Title Interface] </><M_Default> to use it. </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（愣了一下）</>您是怎么看出来的……"] = "<P_Heart> (Stunned for a moment) </> How did you figure that out...",
    ["<h>敲门</>进入房间，确认情况"] = "<h>Knock on the door</> and enter the room to confirm the situation.",
    ["“正义”女士：但今天是你的第一天……"] = "Lady Justice: But today is your first day...",
    ["“死亡天使”，祂曾陷入失忆的诅咒，在主的帮助下逐渐找回自我，成为主的护翼，自亘古到永久。"] = "The “Angel of Death”, He once fell into the curse of amnesia, gradually found himself with the Lord's help, and became the Lord's wings, from ancient times to eternity.",
    ["……<P_Heart>（能强制将我拉入这种空间，而我没有察觉到任何异常。从没听过这种可怕的能力……）</>"] = "...<P_Heart> (To be able to forcibly pull me into this kind of space without me noticing any abnormality. I've never heard of such a terrifying ability...) </>",
    ["……“心脏”对我已经没用了，你拿去完成比赛吧。"] = "…The \"Heart\" is useless to me now, you take it to finish the competition.",
    ["……杀害韦尔奇先生和娜娅女士的罪犯已全部落网，相信蔓延在廷根的恐慌气氛将得到缓解……"] = "...The criminals who murdered Mr. Welch and Ms. Naya have all been apprehended. I believe the atmosphere of Horror spreading through Tingen will be alleviated...",
    ["　　<InvDefault_HW>“我们去吧！”戴莉跳到了鹿角顶端，“就算你在里面迷失了方向，我的歌声也能把我们带到正确的道路上。”</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>它们就这样进入了洞穴，里面结构错综复杂，邓恩和戴莉费了不少力气才找到受伤的蝙蝠一家。就在它们准备离开洞穴的时候，外面狂风大作，无数雪花被风裹挟而来，挡住了所有的光。邓恩又尝试了几个方向，比找不到出口更令人绝望的是蝙蝠一家越来越微弱的呼吸。</>"] = "　　<InvDefault_HW>\"Let's go!\" Daly jumped to the top of the antlers, \"Even if you get lost inside, my singing can lead us on the right path.\"</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>They entered the cave just like that. The structure inside was intricate and complex, and it took Dunn and Daly quite a bit of effort to find the injured bat family. Just as they were preparing to leave the cave, a gale blew outside, and countless snowflakes were carried by the wind, blocking all light. Dunn tried several more directions. More desperate than not finding the exit was the increasingly weak breathing of the bat family.</>",
