    ["工厂区传来醉汉雷克斯责骂洗烟囱童工道奇的声音。你上前制止，得知道奇的哥哥杰姆病重住院，他急需今日工钱治病。你协助道奇完成工作，途中雇主点火催工，道奇险些葬身浓烟。你扑灭火源救出道奇，他却仍被雷克斯以“扫得不干净”为由克扣工钱。道奇终于看清了雷克斯的嘴脸，随你离开。黑心的老板永远不会停下剥削，还有无数个道奇，正在工厂的烟雾里挣扎求生。"] = "In the factory district, you hear the drunkard Rex scolding the chimney sweep boy, Dodge. You step in to stop him and learn that Dodge's brother, Jem, is hospitalized with a serious illness, and he desperately needs today's wages for treatment. You assist Dodge in finishing his work, but the employer lights a fire to rush him, and Dodge nearly dies in the thick smoke. You extinguish the fire and save Dodge, but Rex still withholds his pay, claiming he 'didn't sweep it clean'. Dodge finally sees Rex's true face and leaves with you. Heartless bosses will never stop exploiting, and countless other Dodges are struggling to survive in the factory smoke.",
